  "fixes": [
    "Use full luma bounds for CDEF; subsample only chroma bounds, in serial and parallel paths",
    "Select four-tap kernels for prediction axes at most four pixels, preserving full prediction geometry across transform subdivisions",
    "Select OBMC filters using complete neighbor-strip geometry before the transform intersection",
    "Preserve single-reference separable precision with round_0/round_1=3/11 for 8/10 bit and 5/9 for 12 bit; retain exact 8/10-bit bilinear shortcut",
    "Retain biased fractional compound predictors in existing u16 buffers through translation and warp; remove common bias and clip once after equal, discrete distance or mask blending",
    "Quantize distance weights using normative AV1 threshold table, including wrap, clamp, zero and equal distances",
    "Preserve full output stride across 8x8 warp chunks and correct cross-axis filter phase origin",
    "Correct wedge master tables, oblique reflection and narrow-block sign maps",
    "Use each contributing luma owner reference, MV and filter for shared sub8 chroma regions",
    "Generate chroma masks from the same full-resolution luma predictors and round their subsampling average, including 4:4:4",
    "Correct inter-intra weight orientation, directional masks, chroma wedge reduction and full-block intra edges",
    "Use logical LF reference/mode metadata, normative delta math, MI4 grid, shared chroma ownership, PU boundary and previous-strength fallback",
    "Infer maximum rectangular skipped inter/IntrABC transforms without entropy reads",
    "Use each OBMC primary reference and pair sub8 neighbors with normative limits",
    "Use normative affine reciprocal/rounding and full-plane warp eligibility; anchor full8x8 tiles across transform fragments",
    "Verify every native sample in the bundled60-frame AVIS oracle exactly"
  ],
